# CortexKG does not read `.env` files automatically.
# Use this as a deployment reference for non-secret paths only.
# Provider API keys are configured in the application's Settings panel and are
# persisted locally in `app_config.json`, which is intentionally gitignored.

# Optional: change the location of the generated local configuration file.
# CORTEXKG_CONFIG_FILE=/absolute/path/to/app_config.json
